摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Infinite Canvas — a node-based short-drama studio plugin for DeepSeek Harness: script, multi-shot storyboard, reference-consistent assets, one-shot video generation and final cut. Local-first, bring your own models.","id":"gh:1412882758","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-infinite_canvas","slug":"NINKCH/dsh-infinite_canvas","topics":["deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Infinite Canvas — a node-based short-drama studio plugin for DeepSeek Harness: script, multi-shot st"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"oryboard, reference-consistent assets, one-shot video generation and final cut. Local-first, bring y"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ence-consistent assets, one-shot video generation and final cut. Local-first, bring your own models."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Infinite Canvas for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A node-based short-drama studio inside DeepSeek Harness.** Start from a one-line idea, walk out wi"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"th a storyboarded, voiced, subtitled video cut — right on an infinite canvas."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文 · **User guide: English** · 操作手册（中文）"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What is this?"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Infinite Canvas is a DeepSeek Harness plugin that turns the web GUI's sidebar into a full creation s"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"tudio. Instead of chat round-trips, you work the way directors do: nodes on an infinite canvas, wire"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"d into a pipeline — script, storyboard, character & scene assets, image generation, video generation"},{"id":"p6s4","text":", and a final cut with transitions, subtitles and dubbing."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Everything runs locally in your Harness. Bring your own generation APIs, or use the built-in demo mo"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"de to learn the whole flow with zero configuration."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Drive it from the chat"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The canvas and the agent share one brain. Every node is an AI workbench, and the **chat side is the "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"director**: ask in plain language and the agent operates the canvas tools for you — batch work espec"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"or**: ask in plain language and the agent operates the canvas tools for you — batch work especially."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> *\"Create a project called Time-Postman, write the world view and series bible first.\"*\n> *\"Write e"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"pisode 1 based on the bible.\"* → the script node generates one episode (60–120s), every scene marked"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" with a `【场N】` header.\n> *\"Expand episode 1 into scenes.\"* → per-scene text nodes + storyboard nodes"},{"id":"p10s4","text":" appear, wired automatically.\n> *\"Generate reference images for every character, scene and prop.\"* →"},{"id":"p10s5","text":" ten image nodes created and generated in one go.\n> *\"Generate scene 1's video.\"* → storyboard shots"},{"id":"p10s6","text":" + reference images compose one multi-shot video call.\n> *\"Send episode 1 to FilmCraft for an MP4 re"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"nder.\"* → FCP7 XML + SRT land in your data root for the Craft suite."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The heavy lifting — bibles, episode scripts, storyboard breakdowns, batches of reference images — is"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" exactly what the agent is fast at. You then fine-tune the 20% you care about directly on the nodes:"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" tweak a prompt, reorder references, re-roll one shot, pull an older result from history."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Case study: 门缝里的字条"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"A full episode produced end to end with the flow above. The canvas with the whole episode laid out —"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" the icon rail on the left adds nodes, the **Projects** panel on the right manages the canvases of t"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"he current project (第1集 / 第2集), while assets and the bible stay shared across the project:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Shot 1 up close — storyboard → character/scene turnaround images → video, with the reference relatio"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"nships drawn as edges:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"A node with its generation panel: click the content area to open it — references live in a draggable"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" strip at the top, and model / ratio / quality / count sit on one row:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### What each layer owns"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Layer | Count | Decides | Why it needs its own layer |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| **Director** | 45 | Camera language, lighting, cutting rhythm, style parameters | It constrains th"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"e shot's camera fields, the keyframe, and the video's camera move at once — the least replaceable de"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"cision in the whole piece |\n| **Genre** | 36 narrative / 10 sector | Pressure mechanics, audience pa"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"yoff, scene granules, episode hooks | The same \"revenge\" premise is fragmented neon under Wong Kar-w"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"ai and hard-lit slow motion under Tsui Hark; folding them together poisons both |\n| **Spec** | 8 | S"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"tructure blocks, ASL floor, rhythm, quality bar | It decides \"short drama vs cinematic texture vs co"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"mmercial\", which is orthogonal to genre |\n| **Look** | 9 | Imaging base, material, render texture | "},{"id":"p19s8","text":"2D thick paint / guoman 3D / game CG are imaging domains, not directors; mixing them into the direct"},{"id":"p19s9","text":"or layer makes \"how to cut\" fight \"what it looks like\" |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**Directors (45)**: Chinese 16 (Wong Kar-wai, Zhang Yimou, Hou Hsiao-hsien, Bi Gan, Tsui Hark, Lu Ya"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ng, Yuen Woo-ping, Wu Ershan, Ang Lee, Edward Yang, Jia Zhangke, Jiang Wen, Johnnie To, Ning Hao, St"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ephen Chow, Wong Jing) · Japan/Korea 7 (Kurosawa, Park Chan-wook, Bong Joon-ho, Kore-eda Hirokazu, L"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ee Chang-dong, Miyazaki Hayao, Shinkai Makoto) · Western 22 (Spielberg, Hitchcock, Kubrick, Scorsese"},{"id":"p20s5","text":", Fellini, Bergman, Tarkovsky, Nolan, Villeneuve, Fincher, Refn, Malick, Michael Mann, Coen Brothers"},{"id":"p20s6","text":", Ridley Scott, David Lynch, Alfonso Cuarón, Iñárritu, Wes Anderson, George Miller, Almodóvar, Guy R"},{"id":"p20s7","text":" Scott, David Lynch, Alfonso Cuarón, Iñárritu, Wes Anderson, George Miller, Almodóvar, Guy Ritchie)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Specs (8)**: Short drama · Cinematic texture · Commercial · Documentary · Music video · Trailer · "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"Explainer · Interview."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- A **short drama** is a self-contained 60–180 s unit and **covers both single episodes and multi-ep"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"isode series** — a series is just episode after episode, so there is no separate \"series\" form.\n[该节后"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"e series** — a series is just episode after episode, so there is no separate \"series\" form.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Data & privacy"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- Canvas documents, projects and settings live in browser `localStorage` (`dsh-ic:*`); asset metadat"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"a lives in IndexedDB (`dsh-infinite-canvas`) while media files persist **on disk** once a data root "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"is set (per-project folders by project name, served by the plugin backend with HTTP Range support fo"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"r video seeking).\n- AI text generation runs through the Harness host process (your configured models"},{"id":"p26s5","text":", no extra keys).\n- Image/video/TTS gateway calls are relayed by the local Harness host process (avo"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"ids browser CORS limits); your endpoints and keys stay local.\n- Nothing is uploaded anywhere by the "},{"id":"p26s7","text":"RS limits); your endpoints and keys stay local.\n- Nothing is uploaded anywhere by the plugin itself."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Requirements & limitations"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness 0.2.0-rc.2+; demo video export needs MediaRecorder (Chromium).\n- The preview cut "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"is real-time recorded WebM; for MP4 masters with multi-track editing, pair with ArtCraft FilmCraft o"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"r any NLE.\n- Image `edits`/mask inpainting requires a model that supports the endpoint (e.g. gpt-ima"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ge-1).\n- Host-side plugin updates need one Harness restart; the web half hot-reloads."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
